<title>SPAIN: Eksportfinans issues 10 bln 20-yr 8.40 pct Matador.</title>
<headline>Eksportfinans issues 10 bln 20-yr 8.40 pct Matador.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eksportfinans is issuing a 10 billion 20-year 8.40 percent Matador at an issue price of 100.9161, according to Argentaria, which is joint lead and book manager with Banco Santander de Negocios, BNP and Mutuactivos.</p>
<p>The pay date is October 10 and the issue matures on October 10, 2016.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
